      "confidence": "Weak",
      "cwe_id": [22],
      "note": "find_accessible_book! restricts the lookup to libraries the current user owns or is shared (404 otherwise). Book#absolute_path joins library.path (admin-controlled) with file_path (set by the scanner from disk discovery, never by user input). The controller restricts the resolved path to the owning library root before send_file. The filename argument is built from Book#title via download_filename, which strips control chars, path separators, and quotes so the value cannot break the Content-Disposition header."
    },
